                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "84611627",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198057622074",
                            "num_reviews": 70,
                            "playtime_forever": 140,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 75,
                            "last_played": 1610608345
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is the worst and definitely most unbalanced solitaire game I have ever played, and its not even close. Be prepared to grind for cash to buy powerups, or play same level 10+ times to get enough wild cards every 3 levels or so just to pass a level with 2 or 3 stars. To be more precise, just now I played same level 5 times in a row, where I couldnt move from first 4 cards, going thru whole decks each and every time, I just couldnt move anywhere, so from the get go it is completely impossible for you to even fishih a level, let alone get any stars. Only way to pass it is as I said grind grind and grind with same obnoxious music playing in the background (turning it off is a must or you will go insane). There is no flow in this game, its almost like those wait to win mobile games, game just deals you decks that are impossible to be passed without help via aformentioned powerups and/or wild cards. Also those 3 gems games that come up every now and then are the same. If you want to get all the stars be prepared to be BORED to tears, until you just delete your game from your system like I will most likely do soon. There is no way in hell that I'm buying any more games from this developer, its the same unbalanced garbage like this one. There are way better solitaire games out there, this is not worth your precious time. Believe you me.",
